# Donate to Recycling (otherAreas 16): the other Onion arms of the or-chain. For each of the Dagger, Knife, Rod and
# Staff: accepted (a GM; a GM accept over completed leaves it completed, so `quest ... available` first), 4 of it:
# nothing; 5: 21: completed, the five taken. The staves are traded 6: 21 (npcUtil.tradeHas: at least five), five taken,
# one kept. The weapons do not stack: one `item` line each.
char zone=Selbina pos=-9.0,-11.76,-5.0 job=WAR lvl=20
quest OtherAreas.DonateToRecycling accepted
item OnionDagger
item OnionDagger
item OnionDagger
item OnionDagger
item OnionDagger
item OnionKnife
item OnionKnife
item OnionKnife
item OnionKnife
item OnionKnife
item OnionRod
item OnionRod
item OnionRod
item OnionRod
item OnionRod
item OnionStaff
item OnionStaff
item OnionStaff
item OnionStaff
item OnionStaff
item OnionStaff
login
trade Romeo OnionDagger x4              # 4: nothing
trade Romeo OnionDagger x5              # 21
finish                                  # completed; the daggers taken
quest OtherAreas.DonateToRecycling available  # a GM
quest OtherAreas.DonateToRecycling accepted   # a GM
trade Romeo OnionKnife x4               # 4: nothing
trade Romeo OnionKnife x5               # 21
finish                                  # completed; the knives taken
quest OtherAreas.DonateToRecycling available  # a GM
quest OtherAreas.DonateToRecycling accepted   # a GM
trade Romeo OnionRod x4                 # 4: nothing
trade Romeo OnionRod x5                 # 21
finish                                  # completed; the rods taken
quest OtherAreas.DonateToRecycling available  # a GM
quest OtherAreas.DonateToRecycling accepted   # a GM
trade Romeo OnionStaff x4               # 4: nothing
trade Romeo OnionStaff x6               # 21
finish                                  # completed; five staves taken, one kept
